el/blob/main/INSTALL.md"},{"DocumentLabel":"Lua 配置","DocumentUrl":"https://github.com/Kuddev/pebrel/blob/main/docs/lua-configuration.md"}],"locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Nebula 是一款 Windows 上的终端模拟器，以 Rust 编写，构建在 GPU 加速渲染内核之上，并围绕一个理念设计：终端会话太宝贵，不该随窗口一起消失。它把 tmux 式的常驻会话模型、玻璃质感界面、AI CLI 感知侧边栏和无需额外配置的 shell 体验组合在一起。","releaseNotes":"macOS、Linux 和 Android 下载为预览版。\n改进\n- 改进大目录中的文件和文件夹补全，减少等待建议的时间。 (#914)","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Kuddev/pebrel/releases/tag/v2.5.2","tags":["claude","codex","ssh","终端"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/Kuddev/pebrel/issues","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Kuddev","releaseDate":"2026-11-11","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Kuddev/pebrel/releases/tag/v2.5.2","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"2a5cec868a5770941e79dfb90d24e9d115fd85fd","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/k/Kuddev/Pebrel/2.5.2/Kuddev.Pebrel.installer.yaml","sha256":"7f68429dca6bf421d18ddba872ed13844f440aa157e2b9c47aae815215d87831"},{"path":"manifests/k/Kuddev/Pebrel/2.5.2/Kuddev.Pebrel.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"35b1eed79eb6e885eedfdcd4a548cf06275d0fac0770c133ee161610444f794f"},{"path":"manifests/k/Kuddev/Pebrel/2.5.2/Kuddev.Pebrel.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"519bd72ca0fa523f3cd601b6cbee917c4bfde1d410721b1dc564bba1490e96a3"},{"path":"manifests/k/Kuddev/Pebrel/2.5.2/Kuddev.Pebrel.yaml","sha256":"36185232249109a23b9648dacc5651f0694a7d472a1831bdfc07d0679f02a44a"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"2.5.2"}